   "verdict": "REAL",
   "failure_scenario": "A check prints more than 64,000 characters per stream, and a credential sits where the process runner cuts the output. The runner keeps only the end of the secret before redaction runs, so the full value no longer matches and the leftover part is stored and sent to models. The request asked specifically for secrets that straddle the cut to be caught.",
   "reproduction": "unreproduced: not run here. The ordering is clear from the code.",
